","created_at":"2026-08-30T21:59:29.328718Z","maturity":"official_transcript","revision_number":1}],"schema_version":"1.0","sections":[{"heading":"What this case is about","paragraphs":["This case tests the constitutional limits of legislative power. The core conflict involves the separation of powers between the legislative and executive branches. The Court must determine who holds the authority to defend federal laws in court."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 111, lines 39-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 111, lines 39-47"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 18, lines 11-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 18, lines 11-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 18, lines 9-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 18, lines 9-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 35, lines 19-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 35, lines 19-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 21-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 21-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 58, lines 33-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-307_c18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 58, lines 33-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — f